    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ground floor 1 bedroom apartment in the private and secure complex of Mespil Estate, just off Leeson Street and only a short walk to Grafton Street. Well serviced by the nearby Charlemont Luas tram stop and various Dublin Bus routes. \r\n\r\n-  new energy efficient boiler installed.\r\n- Spacious double bedroom with large 4-door built in wardrobe with ample storage space and bedside locker.\r\n- Large living/dining room consists of 2 leather sofas, 2 side tables, wooden dining table and 4 chairs.\r\n- The kitchen has all the appliances you need: washer/dryer, oven, hob, microwave, kettle fridge/freezer, with an additional freezer in the storage closet in the hall.\r\n- The bathroom has a built-in shower and bath unit.\r\n- Private Swimming Pool for residents on the ground as well as green area.\r\n- Refuse and Recycling also included\r\n- Private parking available on the grounds.\r\n-RTB registerered to allow each tenant to claim back 750 Per year on your tax return"
      },
